<h1 focusTitle>Account settings</h1><div class="row text-large"><div class="col-md-6"><form name="form" (submit)="submit()" style="max-width: 400px; margin-bottom: 100px"><div class="form-group"><h3>Account details</h3></div><div class="form-group"><label for="account-id">Account ID</label><input class="form-control" id="account-id" [value]="account?.id" readonly></div><div class="form-group"><label for="account-name">Account Name</label><input class="form-control" id="account-name" type="text" name="name" [(ngModel)]="data.name" required [maxlength]="nameMaxLength"><small class="form-text text-warning">This name will be visible to other players</small></div><div class="form-group"><label for="birthdate">Date of birth<fa-icon class="ml-1 text-danger" *ngIf="showAccountAlert" [icon]="alertIcon" title="Missing field value"></fa-icon></label><date-picker [(date)]="data.birthdate"></date-picker></div><div class="form-group" *ngIf="accountError"><div class="alert alert-danger">{{accountError}}</div></div><div class="form-group" *ngIf="accountSaved"><div class="alert alert-success">Changes saved</div></div><div class="form-group text-right"><button class="btn btn-default" type="submit" [disabled]="!canSubmit" style="min-width: 100px;">Save</button></div></form><div style="margin-bottom: 100px;"><div class="form-group"><h3>Connected social accounts</h3></div><div class="form-group"><p class="text-muted">If you remove social account, you won't be able to use it to sign-in to the game anymore.
</p></div><div class="form-group"><ul class="list-unstyled"><li class="item-connected-account d-flex justify-content-between" *ngFor="let s of sites"><a [href]="s.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><fa-icon class="mr-1" [icon]="icon(s.icon)" [fixedWidth]="true"></fa-icon><b><span class="sr-only">{{s.icon}}</span> {{s.name}}</b></a><button class="btn btn-sm btn-danger" *ngIf="sites.length &gt; 1" (click)="removeSite(s)" [disabled]="removingSite">remove</button></li></ul></div><div class="form-group"><p class="text-danger">Please do NOT connect any social sites that <b>do not belong to you!</b>
Connecting social sites belonging to other people may result in unexpected account merge
and loss of one or both accounts.</p><p class="text-danger">Please contact our support email if you accidentally merge your account with someone else.</p><div class="dropdown" dropdown><button class="btn btn-default dropdown-toggle" dropdownToggle>connect another social site to this account</button><div class="dropdown-menu" *dropdownMenu><button class="dropdown-item" *ngFor="let p of providers" (click)="connectSite(p)"><fa-icon class="mr-1" [icon]="icon(p.id)" [fixedWidth]="true"></fa-icon><span class="sr-only">{{p.name}}</span> {{p.name}}</button></div></div></div><div class="form-group" *ngIf="mergeError"><div class="alert alert-danger">{{mergeError}}</div></div><div class="form-group" *ngIf="authError"><div class="alert alert-danger">{{authError}}</div></div><div class="form-group" *ngIf="mergedAccount"><div class="alert alert-success">Account connected successfully</div></div><div class="form-group" *ngIf="removedAccount"><div class="alert alert-success">Account removed successfully</div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div style="margin-bottom: 100px;"><div class="clearfix" *ngIf="showSupporter"><div class="form-group"><h3><fa-icon class="mr-2" [icon]="starIcon" [ngClass]="supporterClass"></fa-icon>Thank you for your support</h3></div><supporter-pony class="float-right" #pony (mouseenter)="pony.excite()" (mouseleave)="pony.reset()"></supporter-pony><div class="form-group"><p>Your reward tier: <b>{{supporterTitle}}</b></p><p>Your rewards include:</p><ul><li *ngFor="let r of supporterRewards">{{r}}</li></ul></div><p *ngIf="supporter &gt; 0">Use <code>/ss hello</code> command to use supporter chat color.</p><p *ngIf="supporter &gt; 1">Use <code>/s1 hello</code> and <code>/s2 hello</code> commands to use lower tier supporter chat colors.</p></div><div class="clearfix" *ngIf="showSupporterInfo"><div class="form-group"><h3>Supporter info</h3></div><supporter-pony class="float-right" #pony (mouseenter)="pony.excite()" (mouseleave)="pony.reset()"></supporter-pony><div class="form-group text-muted"><p>You've successfully connected your Patreon account to Pony Town.
If you support Pony Town on Patreon your supporter info will show up here.</p><p>It should take no longer than 10 minutes to register your Patreon pledges.
</p></div></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 100px;"><div class="form-group"><div class="float-right"><span class="text-muted">Page: {{page + 1}}</span><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ml-2" (click)="page = page - 1; pageChanged()" [disabled]="!hides || page === 0">Previous page</button><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ml-1" (click)="page = page + 1; pageChanged()" [disabled]="!hides || hides.length &lt; hidesPerPage">Next page</button></div><h3>Hidden players</h3></div><div *ngIf="!hides"><div class="text-muted text-center p-4">loading...</div></div><ul class="list-unstyled" *ngIf="hides"><div class="text-muted text-center p-4" *ngIf="!hides.length">no hidden players</div><li class="item-connected-account d-flex align-items-center" *ngFor="let h of hides"><b class="flex-grow-1">{{h.name}}</b><span class="text-muted mr-2">hidden {{h.date}}</span><button class="btn btn-sm btn-danger" (click)="unhidePlayer(h)">unhide player</button></li></ul></div></div></div>